{
 "duration": 29.553,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Marcus books Glacier for June tenth, with Going-to-the-Sun Road as the big day.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 4.969
  },
  {
   "text": "He learns the high part of the road is plowed every spring, and usually opens between mid-June and early July.",
   "start": 5.369,
   "end": 12.081
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody knows the day.",
   "start": 12.381,
   "end": 13.582
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 14.032,
   "end": 14.96
  },
  {
   "text": "For the whole road and most trails, go mid-July to mid-September.",
   "start": 15.26,
   "end": 19.027
  },
  {
   "text": "If June is your only week, plan Lake McDonald, Avalanche Lake and Many Glacier instead.",
   "start": 19.377,
   "end": 24.902
  },
  {
   "text": "Marcus moves to late July.",
   "start": 25.352,
   "end": 27.091
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before you book Glacier.",
   "start": 27.541,
   "end": 29.353
  }
 ],
